IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q14-FD-MATURITY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL       PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-RATE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TENURE          PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-IDX             PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MATURITY        PIC 9(12)V9(6) VALUE 0.
01 WS-FINAL-MAT       PIC 9(12)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-MAT        PIC Z(11)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL
ACCEPT WS-RATE
ACCEPT WS-TENURE
MOVE WS-PRINCIPAL TO WS-MATURITY
PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-TENURE
    COMPUTE WS-MATURITY = WS-MATURITY + (WS-MATURITY * WS-RATE / 100)
END-PERFORM
COMPUTE WS-FINAL-MAT ROUNDED = WS-MATURITY
MOVE WS-FINAL-MAT TO WS-DISP-MAT
DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-MAT)
STOP RUN.
